name: Bounded draft artifacts preserve edits and remain separate from accepted context
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: options randori:pasta
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | draft-readiness
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approve-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 4
expect: Protected review calls: 2
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/draft-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
paste-file: @ART/draft-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PASTA draft ready; context unchanged | draft-result
resize: 160x48
live-snap: draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: draft-40x12
expect: PASTA draft ready
ask: Does the draft clearly remain separate from accepted context at all six sizes, with its artifact and next import action reachable by paging?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/preserve-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Draft preserved | edits-preserved
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART preserve
paste-file: @ART/replace-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART replaced
paste-file: @ART/read-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read
paste-file: @ART/canonical-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART canonical
paste-file: @ART/partial-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Partial model artifact | partial-result
expect: Outcome · partial
resize: 160x48
live-snap: partial-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: partial-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: partial-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: partial-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-40x12
keys: Tab
live-snap: partial-full-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-read-40x12-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-read-40x12-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-read-40x12-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-read-40x12-4
ask: Are the malformed stage, source revision uncertainty and unchanged context understandable, with the complete read receipt reachable at 40 columns?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/bad-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART bad
paste-file: @ART/empty-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART empty
paste-file: @ART/import-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART imported
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exact-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exact
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/4 | retained-accounting
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/4 | recovered-accounting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/randori_contracts.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the inactive imported revision and two settled Context requests without starting scans, creating findings or using protected Review calls?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
